    <!-- ============================================
         Section 9: Comparison with other services
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="section" id="comparison" aria-labelledby="compare-heading">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚖️</span>
        <h2 id="compare-heading">他のベクトル検索サービスとの使い分け</h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        AWS には他にもベクトル検索ができるサービスがあります。<strong>「頻繁に検索する」か「たまに検索する」か</strong>、<strong>「最速性能」か「コスト重視」か</strong>で使い分けるのが基本です。
      </p>

      <table class="analogy-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="th-w20">サービス</th>
            <th class="th-w25">得意分野</th>
            <th class="th-w20">レイテンシ</th>
            <th class="th-w35">向いている用途</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="aws-col">S3 Vectors</td>
            <td>大規模・低頻度クエリ</td>
            <td>秒未満 〜 100ms</td>
            <td>数十億スケールのRAG、長期保管、QPSが低いバッチ処理的検索</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="aws-col">OpenSearch Service<br>(k-NN)</td>
            <td>高QPS・低レイテンシ</td>
            <td>ミリ秒単位</td>
            <td>リアルタイム推薦、大量同時アクセス、ハイブリッド検索、ファセット検索</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="aws-col">OpenSearch<br>Serverless</td>
            <td>サーバーレス高性能</td>
            <td>ミリ秒単位</td>
            <td>プロビジョニング不要でリアルタイム性も欲しい場面</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="aws-col">Aurora PostgreSQL<br>(pgvector)</td>
            <td>トランザクション+ベクトル</td>
            <td>ミリ秒単位</td>
            <td>既存RDBと同じ場所で管理したい、中規模のベクトル+行データのJOIN</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="aws-col">MemoryDB<br>(Vector Search)</td>
            <td>超低レイテンシ</td>
            <td>ミリ秒未満</td>
            <td>毎秒数万QPSのリアルタイム検索。インメモリ性能が必要な場面</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="info-box tip">
        <div class="info-box-title">🔄 階層ストレージ戦略（S3 Vectors × OpenSearch）</div>
        <p class="info-note-zero">
          大量のベクトルを S3 Vectors に低コスト保管し、<strong>高性能が必要な一部だけ OpenSearch Serverless にスナップショットをエクスポート</strong>する構成が可能。
          「全量は S3 Vectors、ホットデータだけ OpenSearch」というコストと性能のベストバランス設計ができます。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================
         Section 10: Code examples
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="section" id="code" aria-labelledby="code-heading">
      <h2 id="code-heading">💻 10. コード例（CLI / CloudFormation / Terraform / Python）</h2>

      <p>
        基本操作は「<strong>バケット作成 → インデックス作成 → ベクトル投入 → クエリ</strong>」の4段階です。
        以下のタブで、各ツールでの書き方を比較できます。
      </p>

      <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="コード例">
        <div class="tab-buttons">
          <button type="button" class="tab-button active" data-tab="cli" role="tab">AWS CLI</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-button" data-tab="cfn" role="tab">CloudFormation</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-button" data-tab="tf" role="tab">Terraform</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-button" data-tab="py" role="tab">Python (boto3)</button>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content active" data-tab="cli" role="tabpanel">
<pre class="code-block"><span class="code-comment"># 1. ベクトルバケット作成</span>
aws s3vectors create-vector-bucket \\
  --vector-bucket-name <span class="code-string">my-vector-bucket</span> \\
  --region <span class="code-string">ap-northeast-1</span>

<span class="code-comment"># 2. ベクトルインデックス作成（次元数・距離メトリクスを指定）</span>
aws s3vectors create-index \\
  --vector-bucket-name <span class="code-string">my-vector-bucket</span> \\
  --index-name <span class="code-string">books-index</span> \\
  --data-type <span class="code-string">float32</span> \\
  --dimension <span class="code-number">1024</span> \\
  --distance-metric <span class="code-string">cosine</span>

<span class="code-comment"># 3. ベクトル投入（バッチで最大500件まで）</span>
aws s3vectors put-vectors \\
  --vector-bucket-name <span class="code-string">my-vector-bucket</span> \\
  --index-name <span class="code-string">books-index</span> \\
  --vectors <span class="code-string">'[
    {
      "key": "book-001",
      "data": {"float32": [0.12, 0.34, 0.56, ...]},
      "metadata": {"genre": "mystery", "year": 2024}
    }
  ]'</span>

<span class="code-comment"># 4. 類似度検索（Top-Kで似た本を取得）</span>
aws s3vectors query-vectors \\
  --vector-bucket-name <span class="code-string">my-vector-bucket</span> \\
  --index-name <span class="code-string">books-index</span> \\
  --query-vector <span class="code-string">'{"float32": [0.11, 0.33, 0.55, ...]}'</span> \\
  --top-k <span class="code-number">5</span> \\
  --filter <span class="code-string">'{"genre": {"$eq": "mystery"}}'</span> \\
  --return-metadata</pre>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content" data-tab="cfn" role="tabpanel">
<pre class="code-block"><span class="code-comment"># CloudFormation テンプレート（YAML）</span>
AWSTemplateFormatVersion: <span class="code-string">'2010-09-09'</span>
Description: S3 Vectors bucket and index

Resources:
  <span class="code-keyword">MyVectorBucket</span>:
    Type: AWS::S3Vectors::VectorBucket
    Properties:
      VectorBucketName: <span class="code-string">my-vector-bucket</span>
      EncryptionConfiguration:
        SseType: <span class="code-string">AES256</span>

  <span class="code-keyword">MyVectorIndex</span>:
    Type: AWS::S3Vectors::Index
    Properties:
      VectorBucketName: !Ref MyVectorBucket
      IndexName: <span class="code-string">books-index</span>
      DataType: <span class="code-string">float32</span>
      Dimension: <span class="code-number">1024</span>
      DistanceMetric: <span class="code-string">cosine</span>
      MetadataConfiguration:
        NonFilterableMetadataKeys:
          - <span class="code-string">source_url</span>
          - <span class="code-string">raw_text</span>

Outputs:
  BucketName:
    Value: !Ref MyVectorBucket
  IndexName:
    Value: !Ref MyVectorIndex</pre>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content" data-tab="tf" role="tabpanel">
<pre class="code-block"><span class="code-comment"># Terraform (AWS Provider)</span>
<span class="code-keyword">resource</span> <span class="code-string">"aws_s3vectors_vector_bucket"</span> <span class="code-string">"main"</span> {
  vector_bucket_name = <span class="code-string">"my-vector-bucket"</span>

  encryption_configuration {
    sse_type = <span class="code-string">"AES256"</span>
  }
}

<span class="code-keyword">resource</span> <span class="code-string">"aws_s3vectors_index"</span> <span class="code-string">"books"</span> {
  vector_bucket_name = aws_s3vectors_vector_bucket.main.vector_bucket_name
  index_name         = <span class="code-string">"books-index"</span>
  data_type          = <span class="code-string">"float32"</span>
  dimension          = <span class="code-number">1024</span>
  distance_metric    = <span class="code-string">"cosine"</span>

  metadata_configuration {
    non_filterable_metadata_keys = [<span class="code-string">"source_url"</span>, <span class="code-string">"raw_text"</span>]
  }
}

<span class="code-keyword">output</span> <span class="code-string">"bucket_name"</span> {
  value = aws_s3vectors_vector_bucket.main.vector_bucket_name
}</pre>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content" data-tab="py" role="tabpanel">
<pre class="code-block"><span class="code-keyword">import</span> boto3

client = boto3.client(<span class="code-string">'s3vectors'</span>, region_name=<span class="code-string">'ap-northeast-1'</span>)

<span class="code-comment"># 1. バケット作成</span>
client.create_vector_bucket(vectorBucketName=<span class="code-string">'my-vector-bucket'</span>)

<span class="code-comment"># 2. インデックス作成</span>
client.create_index(
    vectorBucketName=<span class="code-string">'my-vector-bucket'</span>,
    indexName=<span class="code-string">'books-index'</span>,
    dataType=<span class="code-string">'float32'</span>,
    dimension=<span class="code-number">1024</span>,
    distanceMetric=<span class="code-string">'cosine'</span>,
)

<span class="code-comment"># 3. ベクトル投入（バッチで最大500件）</span>
client.put_vectors(
    vectorBucketName=<span class="code-string">'my-vector-bucket'</span>,
    indexName=<span class="code-string">'books-index'</span>,
    vectors=[
        {
            <span class="code-string">'key'</span>: <span class="code-string">'book-001'</span>,
            <span class="code-string">'data'</span>: {<span class="code-string">'float32'</span>: embedding_vector},
            <span class="code-string">'metadata'</span>: {<span class="code-string">'genre'</span>: <span class="code-string">'mystery'</span>, <span class="code-string">'year'</span>: <span class="code-number">2024</span>},
        },
    ],
)

<span class="code-comment"># 4. 類似度検索（メタデータフィルタ付き）</span>
response = client.query_vectors(
    vectorBucketName=<span class="code-string">'my-vector-bucket'</span>,
    indexName=<span class="code-string">'books-index'</span>,
    queryVector={<span class="code-string">'float32'</span>: query_embedding},
    topK=<span class="code-number">5</span>,
    filter={<span class="code-string">'genre'</span>: {<span class="code-string">'$eq'</span>: <span class="code-string">'mystery'</span>}},
    returnMetadata=<span class="code-keyword">True</span>,
    returnDistance=<span class="code-keyword">True</span>,
)

<span class="code-keyword">for</span> hit <span class="code-keyword">in</span> response[<span class="code-string">'vectors'</span>]:
    <span class="code-keyword">print</span>(hit[<span class="code-string">'key'</span>], hit[<span class="code-string">'distance'</span>], hit[<span class="code-string">'metadata'</span>])</pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box tip">
        <div class="info-box-title">💡 Embedding 生成は別サービス</div>
        <p class="info-note-zero">
          S3 Vectors は<strong>保管とクエリが専門</strong>で、テキストや画像からベクトルを作る処理（Embedding）は
          <strong>Amazon Bedrock（Titan Embeddings、Cohere Embed 等）や SageMaker</strong>で行います。
          生成したベクトルを <code>put-vectors</code> に渡す、という役割分担を押さえておきましょう。
        </p>
      </div>

